Z||000003||AkursedX||04-12-2001||12:21 AM||||Paranoia keeps you alive.  ||||reg||14
Z||000004||Formula88||04-12-2001||09:44 AM||||Cartoon Physics:  A cat is gaseous in nature and will expand to fill the container it is placed in.<P>Cartoon Theory of Reality:  Any reality not observed by the subject does not exist.  This is why you can walk off a cliff and not start to fall until you realize you're in mid air.  Once you recognize the reality, gravity exists and you begin to fall.  Conversely, sufficient denial of reality will keep the subject afloat indefinately.<P>Murphy was an optimist.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||10
